// User Stories
User Story 1: As a parent, I would love my child to have a good night’s rest without any disturbances and with calming music.

User Story 2: As a nanny, I would love to be able to multitask taking care of the home and monitoring the baby at the same time.

User Story 3: As a working parent, I want a way to monitor the baby more closely and talk to it to strengthen our bond.


